<title>USA: Quickturn Design stake cut by FMR group.</title>
<headline>Quickturn Design stake cut by FMR group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by FMR Corp said Thursday it lowered its stake in Quickturn Design Systems Inc to 861,142 common shares or 5.11 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include a net 170,000 shares sold between February 28 and April 1 at prices ranging from $8.5399 to $16 per share.</p>
<p>The group holds the stake in the Mountain View, Calif., company for investment purposes.</p>
